# Build-context ignore for explorer/Dockerfile (honoured by BuildKit as
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). Keeps the context small and the build deterministic:
# only the core crate, the sdk and the explorer are copied in the Dockerfile, and
# none of their build artefacts or the repo's VCS/worktree state belong in it.
**/target
**/*.rlib
.git
.github
# Crates the explorer build does not touch — excluded so an edit to them can never
# change the explorer image or its context hash.
program
zkvm
app
vendor
tools
artifacts
idl
docs
scripts
*.md
